{"metadata":{"name":"Jami At Tirmidhi","name_native":"Jami At-Tirmidhi","section":{"14":"The Book on Business"},"section_detail":{"14":{"hadithnumber_first":1205,"hadithnumber_last":1321,"arabicnumber_first":1205,"arabicnumber_last":1321,"name_native":"The Book on Business"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1313,"arabicnumber":1313,"text":"Narrated Abu Az-Zubair: From Jabir that the Prophet (ﷺ) prohibited Al-Muhaqalah, Al-Muzabanah, Al-Mukhabarah, and Al-Mu'awamah, and he permitted it in the case of Al-'Araya. [Abu 'Eisa said:] This Hadith is Hasan Sahih","grades":[{"name":"Ahmad Muhammad Shakir","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Hadith"},{"name":"Bashar Awad Maarouf","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"}],"reference":{"book":14,"hadith":116}}]}